      "text": "he shall save his people from their sins, Matt. 1:21. my spirit hath rejoiced in God my Saviour, Luke 1:47. born … in the city of David a Saviour, which is Christ, Luke 2:11. world through him might be saved, John 3:17. this is indeed the Christ, the Saviour, John 4:42. whosoever shall call on the … Lord shall be saved, Acts 2:21. none other name … whereby we must be saved, Acts 4:12 (2 Ne. 25:20; Mosiah 3:17; 5:8; D&C 18:23; Moses 6:52). Him hath God exalted … to be a Prince and a Saviour, Acts 5:31. did God send to be a ruler and a deliverer, Acts 7:35. raised unto Israel a Saviour, Jesus, Acts 13:23. shouldest be for salvation unto the ends of the earth, Acts 13:47. shall come out of Sion the Deliverer, Rom. 11:26. we look for the Saviour, the Lord Jesus Christ, Philip. 3:20. we trust in the living God, who is the Saviour, 1 Tim. 4:10. glorious appearing of … our Saviour, Titus 2:13. he is the propitiation for our sins, 1 Jn. 2:2. sent the Son to be the Saviour, 1 Jn. 4:14.",
